FCNB  .                              :3       Cumulative number of fractures in the uphole direction
FVPA  .V/V                           :4       Apparent Electrical Fracture Porosity_ Ratio of the apparent area of fractures seen on the borehole wall over the area of borehole for a given window height
FVAH  .IN                            :5       Hydraulic Electrical Fracture Aperture_ Cube root of the cube of the fracture trace aperture summed over a given window height
FVA   .IN                            :6       Electrical Fracture Aperture_ Mean value of fracture trace aperture averaged over a given window height
FVDA  .FT-1                          :7       Apparent Fracture Density_ Number of fractures per feet within a given window height
FVTL  .FT-1                          :8       Areal Trace Length_ Cumulated fracture trace length seen per unit area of borehole wall within a given window height
FVDC  .FT-1                          :9       Corrected Fracture Density_ Apparent Fracture Density (FVDA) corrected for the orientation bias (angle between fracture plane and borehole axis)
